             ['Live tyre telemetry', 'Yes, in team mode', 'Public mode ingests timing, car data, gaps, weather, radio records and derived proxies; team mode adds pressures, temperatures, slip, steering, fuel, set identity through the same adapter interface', 'The 2026 regulations mandate tyre pressure and temperature sensors on every car, but those channels are not public. Public live data: FastF1\'s live-timing recorder is free and must run during the session; OpenF1 real-time is a paid tier, its history is free with a delay'],
